<title>CHINA: SOCCER-RESULTS OF CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE MATCHES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the results of China's professional soccer league games played on Thursday:</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodong	2    Beijing Guoan	2</p>
<p> Dalian Wuanda	 1    Shanghai Shenhua   0</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu	1    Guangdong Hongyuan 0</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxing    3    Guangzhou Apollo   0</p>
<p> Tianjin Samsung     2    Jinan Taishan	1</p>
<p> August First	  2    Vanguard Huandao   1</p>
</text>
